Z||000020||Pyric||11-30-2001||05:59 PM||||My brother was in an accident while driving a Fiero.  The guy who hit him practically collapsed the axle.  He was fine, but he still claims that he almost broke down as they dragged the fiero away, bleeding Antifreeze.<P>Every time I start to catch myself driving recklessly, I make a visit to the boneyard.  Seeing what happened to the cars there is a sobering experience.  <P>Do me a favor, and none of you let something like this... be your last post.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||9
