Z||000026||Spektrum-87GT||12-01-2001||12:23 AM||||its sad this happened... looks like he was going FAST... i saw a picture of a fiero going over 60mph and slammed into a tree... it didnt look near as bad as that. The driver of that accident actually survived with a few broken bones(the tree crash), shows the ironic safety of our little 'death traps' as most people like to call them  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>people have died in volvos... people have died in fieros... cars are dangerous!!! buckle up!<P>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/spektrum_87gt/" TARGET=_blank>87 Fiero GT</A><BR>1991 Jeep Cherokee<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://members.home.com/bspracklin1/sig2.jpg">   <BR>AIM:<FONT COLOR="red">S</FONT><FONT COLOR="purple">p</FONT><FONT COLOR="blue">e</FONT><FONT COLOR="cyan">k</FONT><FONT COLOR="green">t</FONT><FONT COLOR="yellow">r</FONT><FONT COLOR="orange">u</FONT><FONT COLOR="red">m</FONT><FONT COLOR="purple">1</FONT><FONT COLOR="blue">1</FONT><FONT COLOR="cyan">7</FONT><BR>And no! i'm not gay dangit!||||reg||1
