Z||000028||FieroKyle||12-01-2001||01:15 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Homicidal:<BR><B> I don't know why, but I found this very, very distasteful.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Same here, other than that I agree with everyone here. The Fiero seemed to of held up great, but thats not the point. He was still killed. It bothers me when I hear people getting killed in Fieros.<P>I remember one time I got picked up have my Olds Ciera threw a rod just the day I bought it, (put a whopping 3 miles on it, but I got my money back) and I was talking about this was my winter car. Then he told me a story how his best friend got killed when his Fiero caught fire. Sorta made me feel bad because he didn't look back on it very well. The guy was about 22. After that we didn't talk at all.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>      <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fierokylesig_1.gif">      <P>My Fast 'n Black Car<BR>Kyle - 85' GT||||reg||9
